      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"investmentDecision\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-219",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"portfolioOptimizer(.marketConditions, .riskPreferences, .constraints)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-220",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@volatile\": true"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-221",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-222",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"execution\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-223",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"executeTrades(.investmentDecision, .liquidityConstraints)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-224",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@caps\": [\"trading-api\"],"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-225",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@sig\": {\"required\": [\"compliance-officer\"]}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-226",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-227",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-228",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@constraint\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-229",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"regulatoryCompliance\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-230",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".portfolio.concentration < 0.1\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-231",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"Portfolio too concentrated in single asset\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-232",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-233",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"liquidityRequirement\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-234",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".cash > .assets * 0.05\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-235",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"Insufficient cash for redemptions\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-236",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-237",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-238",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-239",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-240",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Implication**: AI agents can autonomously manage real economic value within **mathematically enforced guardrails**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-241",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**9. LLM + LD-C Hybrid Reasoning**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-242",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Structured Reasoning Process**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-243",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-244",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-245",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@type\": \"ComplexReasoningTask\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-246",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"query\": \"Should we invest in Company XYZ given current market conditions?\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-247",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@rule\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-248",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"financialAnalysis\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-249",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"analyzeFinancials(.companyData.financialStatements)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-250",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@depends\": [\"companyData\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-251",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-252",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"marketAnalysis\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-253",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"analyzeMarketConditions(.sectorData, .economicIndicators)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-254",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@depends\": [\"sectorData\", \"economicIndicators\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-255",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-256",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"finalRecommendation\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-257",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"synthesizeRecommendation(.financialAnalysis, .marketAnalysis, .riskProfile)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-258",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@depends\": [\"financialAnalysis\", \"marketAnalysis\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-259",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-260",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-261",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@view\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-262",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"reasoningChain\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-263",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@query\": \"\"\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-264",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "SELECT ?step ?input ?output ?confidence"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-265",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "WHERE {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-266",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "?analysisStep :step ?step ;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-267",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ":input ?input ;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-268",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ":output ?output ;"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-269",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ":confidence ?confidence ."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-270",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "} ORDER BY ?step"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-271",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"\"\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-272",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-273",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-274",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-275",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-276",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Implication**: LLMs can leverage LD-C for **structured, verifiable sub-reasoning** while handling natural language interfaces."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-277",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**10. AI Governance & Compliance**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-278",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Regulatory Compliance for AI Systems**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-279",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```json"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-280",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "{"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-281",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@type\": \"AIGovernanceFramework\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-282",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"regulations\": [\"GDPR\", \"SEC AI Rules\", \"EU AI Act\"],"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-283",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@constraint\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-284",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"explainability\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-285",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".aiSystem.providesExplanations == true\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-286",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"AI system must provide decision explanations\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-287",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-288",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"humanOversight\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-289",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".criticalDecisions.humanApprovalRequired == true\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-290",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"Critical decisions require human approval\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-291",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-292",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"dataPrivacy\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-293",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \".trainingData.anonymized == true && .trainingData.consentObtained == true\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@message\": \"Training data violates privacy regulations\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-295",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-296",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "},"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-297",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@rule\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-298",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"complianceReport\": {"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-299",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@expr\": \"generateComplianceReport(.aiSystem, .regulations)\","
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-300",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "\"@depends\": [\"aiSystem\"]"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-301",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-302",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-303",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-304",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "```"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-305",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Transformative Implications**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-306",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**For AI Safety:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-311",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-307",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Mathematical guarantees** instead of probabilistic alignment"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-308",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Constraint enforcement** that cannot be reasoned around"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-309",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Audit trails** for every significant decision"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-310",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Multi-agent coordination** with verified outcomes"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-312",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**For Enterprise AI:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-317",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-313",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Regulatory compliance** built into the reasoning process"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-314",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Financial accuracy** through verified computations"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-315",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Risk management** as a first-class concern"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-316",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Explainable AI** with full provenance"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-318",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**For AI Development:**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-323",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-319",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Testing and validation** as inherent properties"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-320",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Continuous monitoring** of AI behavior against constraints"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-321",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Version control** for AI reasoning patterns"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-322",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Composition** of verified AI components"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-324",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**The Killer App: Trustworthy Autonomous Systems**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-325",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "LD-C enables AI systems that can be:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-331",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-326",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Trusted** with financial decisions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-327",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Audited** by regulators"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-328",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Composed** into complex workflows"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-329",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Governed** by mathematical constraints"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "b-330",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Verified** to be correct and compliant"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-332",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This transforms AI from \"black box predictors\" to **verifiable reasoning engines** that can reliably operate in high-stakes environments like finance, healthcare, and governance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-333",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The combination of LLMs for flexible reasoning and LD-C for verifiable computation creates AI systems that are both powerful and trustworthy - addressing the fundamental limitation that has prevented AI from being deployed in many critical domains."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}